{{! Governing: SPEC-0001 REQ "Checker Table", SPEC-0001 REQ "Pinned Critical
    Modules", SPEC-0001 REQ "Copy Report Button", SPEC-0001 "Accessibility
    Requirements", ADR-0002. Rendered by scripts/checker-table.js
    (CheckerTableApp). }}
<div class="the-plugin-plugin-checker-table">

  {{! Governing: SPEC-0001 REQ "Checker Table" — "The window MUST display a
      visible reminder that package developers are volunteers and that a
      lagging or unverified status does not mean a package will never be
      updated." CLAUDE.md project rule 1. Always visible, not dismissible. }}
  <p class="kindness-reminder">
    <i class="fa-solid fa-heart" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    {{kindnessReminder}}
  </p>

  <p class="developer-declared-note">{{developerDeclaredNote}}</p>

  {{! Governing: ADR-0001 (amended 2026-08-15), SPEC-0001 REQ "Target
      Version Determination", SPEC-0001 REQ "Inferred Latest Version" — the
      comparison target is confirmed by Foundry itself (game.data.coreUpdate)
      when available, otherwise inferred from other installed packages'
      manifests. An inference is never presented as confirmed fact: the
      "inferred" state gets its own wording and icon, never the "confirmed"
      ones. }}
  {{#if comparisonTarget}}
  <p class="comparison-target-note developer-declared-note {{comparisonTarget.statusClass}}">
    <i class="fa-solid {{comparisonTarget.iconClass}}" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    {{comparisonTarget.note}}
  </p>
  {{/if}}

  <div class="checker-toolbar">
    <button type="button" data-action="rescan">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      {{localize "THE-PLUGIN-PLUGIN.CheckerTable.Rescan"}}
    </button>
    {{! Governing: SPEC-0001 "Accessibility Requirements" § Dynamic Content
        Regions — aria-live="polite" status text. }}
    <span class="scan-status" aria-live="polite">{{scanStatusMessage}}</span>
  </div>

  {{! Governing: SPEC-0001 REQ "Checker Table" — "The window MUST display a
      legend naming every icon-only control the table renders." Covers the
      five controls that carry no visible text of their own (star toggle,
      three link-outs, copy-report); the heart/comparison-target/provenance
      icons are deliberately absent, since each already sits beside its own
      explanatory sentence and a legend entry would only restate it.

      Static markup rather than a `_prepareContext`-built view-model: the icon
      set is fixed in this template, so a context array would only restate it
      (CLAUDE.md project rule 2). The icons are aria-hidden and the legend
      itself is not focusable — screen readers get each control's specific
      action from its own aria-label (Accessibility Requirements § Icon-Only
      Controls); this legend is the sighted-GM equivalent of those labels. }}
  <div class="icon-legend">
    <span class="icon-legend-heading" id="the-plugin-plugin-icon-legend-heading">
      {{localize "THE-PLUGIN-PLUGIN.CheckerTable.LegendHeading"}}
    </span>
    <ul aria-labelledby="the-plugin-plugin-icon-legend-heading">
      <li>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-star" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        {{localize "THE-PLUGIN-PLUGIN.CheckerTable.LegendStar"}}
      </li>
      <li>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        {{localize "THE-PLUGIN-PLUGIN.CheckerTable.LegendProjectPage"}}
      </li>
      <li>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-bug" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        {{localize "THE-PLUGIN-PLUGIN.CheckerTable.LegendReportIssue"}}
      </li>
      <li>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-clock-rotate-left" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        {{localize "THE-PLUGIN-PLUGIN.CheckerTable.LegendChangelog"}}
      </li>
      <li>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        {{localize "THE-PLUGIN-PLUGIN.CheckerTable.LegendCopyReport"}}
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  {{! Governing: SPEC-0001 "Accessibility Requirements" § ARIA Landmarks —
      role="main" on the results table region. }}
  <div role="main" aria-label="{{resultsRegionLabel}}" class="checker-table-region">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th class="col-pin">
            <span class="visually-hidden">{{localize "THE-PLUGIN-PLUGIN.CheckerTable.ColumnPin"}}</span>
          </th>
          <th class="col-package">{{localize "THE-PLUGIN-PLUGIN.CheckerTable.ColumnPackage"}}</th>
          <th class="col-installed">{{localize "THE-PLUGIN-PLUGIN.CheckerTable.ColumnInstalled"}}</th>
          <th class="col-latest">{{localize "THE-PLUGIN-PLUGIN.CheckerTable.ColumnLatest"}}</th>
          <th class="col-verified">{{localize "THE-PLUGIN-PLUGIN.CheckerTable.ColumnVerified"}}</th>
          <th class="col-status">{{localize "THE-PLUGIN-PLUGIN.CheckerTable.ColumnStatus"}}</th>
          <th class="col-links">{{localize "THE-PLUGIN-PLUGIN.CheckerTable.ColumnLinks"}}</th>
          <th class="col-report">
            <span class="visually-hidden">{{localize "THE-PLUGIN-PLUGIN.CheckerTable.ColumnReport"}}</span>
          </th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#each rows as |row|}}
        <tr class="package-row severity-{{row.severityClass}} status-{{row.statusLabelKey}}">
          <td class="col-pin">
            <button type="button"
                    class="pin-toggle {{#if row.isPinned}}pinned{{/if}}"
                    data-action="togglePin"
                    data-module-id="{{row.id}}"
                    aria-pressed="{{row.isPinned}}"
                    aria-label="{{row.ariaLabels.pin}}">
              <i class="fa-{{#if row.isPinned}}solid{{else}}regular{{/if}} fa-star" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </button>
          </td>
          <td class="col-package">
            {{row.title}}
            {{! Governing: SPEC-0002 REQ "Result Provenance", SPEC-0002
                Accessibility Requirements § Icon-Only Controls (issue #48) —
                a fallback-sourced row (ADR-0003: read from the repository's
                default branch, not a published release) is visually
                distinguished here; a declared-sourced row (row.provenance is
                null) renders no marking at all. The source is already named
                in visible text, so this isn't an icon-only control and isn't
                an outright violation without an aria-label — but the
                accessibility requirement asks for a text alternative naming
                the source specifically, so the outer span carries an
                explicit aria-label with that same text (row.provenance.note
                — the same ProvenanceFallbackNote content rendered visibly,
                not new wording), rather than leaving the accessible name to
                be assembled implicitly from the icon + text children. }}
            {{#if row.provenance}}
            <span class="provenance-badge {{row.provenance.statusClass}}" aria-label="{{row.provenance.note}}">
              <i class="fa-solid {{row.provenance.iconClass}}" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              {{row.provenance.note}}
            </span>
            {{/if}}
          </td>
          <td class="col-installed">{{row.installedVersion}}</td>
          <td class="col-latest">{{row.latestVersion}}</td>
          <td class="col-verified">{{row.verified}}</td>
          <td class="col-status">
            <span class="status-badge severity-{{row.severityClass}}">{{row.statusLabel}}</span>
          </td>
          <td class="col-links">
            {{#if row.links.url}}
            <a href="{{row.links.url}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="{{row.ariaLabels.url}}">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </a>
            {{/if}}
            {{#if row.links.issue}}
            <a href="{{row.links.issue}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="{{row.ariaLabels.issue}}">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-bug" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </a>
            {{/if}}
            {{#if row.links.changelog}}
            <a href="{{row.links.changelog}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="{{row.ariaLabels.changelog}}">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-clock-rotate-left" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </a>
            {{/if}}
          </td>
          <td class="col-report">
            <button type="button" data-action="copyReport" data-module-id="{{row.id}}" aria-label="{{row.ariaLabels.copy}}">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </button>
          </td>
        </tr>
        {{else}}
        <tr class="empty-row">
          <td colspan="8">
            {{#if loading}}
              {{localize "THE-PLUGIN-PLUGIN.CheckerTable.Scanning"}}
            {{else if scanError}}
              {{localize "THE-PLUGIN-PLUGIN.CheckerTable.ScanError"}}
            {{else}}
              {{localize "THE-PLUGIN-PLUGIN.CheckerTable.NoPackages"}}
            {{/if}}
          </td>
        </tr>
        {{/each}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>
